<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Pedro Monteclaro</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Pedro Monteclaro was a Filipino writer and local official from Miagao, Iloilo, on the island of Panay. In 1907 he published the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maragtas">Maragtas</a>, a legendary history of Panay that he said was drawn from older writings and oral tradition. The book was long treated as history before scholars showed it to be a modern compilation.</p></div>
